Dear Users of ConsensusClusterPlus,

ConsensusClusterPlus was updated to version 1.5.1.  This update 
re-incorporates earlier changes that were in ConsensusClusterPlus 
version 1.0.1 and Bioconductor version 2.6, into Bioconductor version 
2.8 and the development version 2.9.  Bioc version 2.7 did not include 
these changes.

The significant change is a correction to the calcICL function and 
corresponding bar chart. The core ConsensusClusterPlus function is the 
same and produces the same results as earlier versions.

I recommend that users upgrade to the latest Bioconductor version (2.8) 
and ConsensusClusterPlus version (1.5.1). Please contact me if you have 
questions.

Thank you,
Matt Wilkerson


